<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post7488632550066234769..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Blackmailer-in-Chief: Bush Threatens The Troops</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>7</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5313005763766706905</id><published>2007-04-07T10:04:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-07T10:04:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon.  The &quot;root&quot;, or at least part of our problem...</title><content type='html'>Anon.  The &quot;root&quot;, or at least part of our problems, could be traced to that first act of rebellion, but just how many people around you are looking themselves in the mirror and admitting as much?  I&#39;ve never met a man yet who has confided he wanted &quot;god-hood&quot;.  Still, deep down, thats an issue that won&#39;t go away.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Now as far as what our nation &quot;deserves&quot;.... well, I&#39;d say we haven&#39;t even come close to getting our fair share of blood and destruction.  My belief is that through the prayers of a saintly few we&#39;ve been protected so far.  Now when the day comes that the Allmighty takes his finger off the balance, and the full weight of all the evil this nation and its people  have wrought comes crashing down, that&#39;ll be a frightful day indeed.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Only the blind, or willfully ignorant, cannot see this.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/5313005763766706905'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/5313005763766706905'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175961840000#c5313005763766706905' title=''/><author><name>DrFix</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15912619928812368990</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-872085076"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 7, 2007 at 10:04 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1880110782408019067</id><published>2007-04-06T21:31:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-06T21:31:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>We are equal or We are Not-\Every misconception/de...</title><content type='html'>We are equal or We are Not-\Every misconception/deception,  we are seeing in our lives is because of the ideas of Evolution theory and It&#39;s teachings against Gods law. Period!&lt;BR/&gt;And That&#39;s a Fact!&lt;BR/&gt;Every Evil that Men perpatrate against their fellow Man, is Evil taught to them that They are Gods, and that they donot have to respect the true Creator!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/1880110782408019067'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/1880110782408019067'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175916660000#c1880110782408019067' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 6, 2007 at 9:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3362437516383468402</id><published>2007-04-03T23:16:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-03T23:16:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Touche&#39; on the White Rose quote. I pray my neighbo...</title><content type='html'>Touche&#39; on the White Rose quote. I pray my neighbors prove themselves undeserving of what I&#39;m unwilling to endure.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And, yes, Mercy v. Justice was exactly where I was headed.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/3362437516383468402'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/3362437516383468402'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175663760000#c3362437516383468402' title=''/><author><name>Norm DeGuerre</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03034501757931992069</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-489374735"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2007 at 11:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8128640988994902321</id><published>2007-04-03T21:43:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-03T21:43:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&#39;ll see your trenchant Frederick Douglass quote, ...</title><content type='html'>I&#39;ll see your trenchant Frederick Douglass quote, and raise you with one from the White Rose: “Do not forget that every people deserves the regime it is willing to endure!”&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Your point about avoiding the regime we deserve is quite provocative. After all, our entire hope for salvation resides in the promise that we&#39;ll get something other than what we abundantly deserve.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/8128640988994902321'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/8128640988994902321'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175658180000#c8128640988994902321' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2007 at 9:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6605661850768527354</id><published>2007-04-03T21:13:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-03T21:13:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I don&#39;t know that I agree with the concept of the ...</title><content type='html'>I don&#39;t know that I agree with the concept of the people getting the gov&#39;t they &quot;deserve&quot;; God help us, if that ever happens (I&#39;m rather hoping to avoid what I deserve). I more suspect that we get the gov&#39;t that we&#39;ll tolerate:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Find out just what any people will quietly submit to and you have found the. exact measure of injustice and wrong, which will be imposed upon them&quot; - Frederick Douglass</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/6605661850768527354'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/6605661850768527354'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175656380000#c6605661850768527354' title=''/><author><name>Norm DeGuerre</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03034501757931992069</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-489374735"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2007 at 9:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1249686991079287793</id><published>2007-04-03T20:21:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-03T20:21:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous, your view that Bush and his ilk &quot;are a ...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous, your view that Bush and his ilk &quot;are a judgment upon this nation&quot; brings to mind the assessment of John Cooke, who prosecuted Charles I (and was executed for doing so during the Stuart restoration).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Cooke never got to present his case against Charles I, because the king adamantly refused to enter a plea; doing so would have recognized the legitimacy of Parliament as the voice of the English people, and of the court Parliament created. By the established legal practices of the era, a refusal to plea was a guilty plea by default. It was on that basis that Charles was convicted. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A week after Charles I was executed  Cooke published his indictment of the tyrant under the title &quot;King Charles, His Case.&quot; The book began with the memorable description of the departed monarch as &quot;King Charles ... a king whom God gave to England in His wrath and will take away out of his love for that country....&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The description certainly applies to the pampered Pinhead in the Oval Office. Would that the resolution of our difficulties be the same, at least where conviction is concerned.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/1249686991079287793'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/1249686991079287793'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175653260000#c1249686991079287793' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2007 at 8:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4340661250531629966</id><published>2007-04-03T20:01:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-04-03T20:01:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>You hit the nail right on the head. George Bush ar...</title><content type='html'>You hit the nail right on the head. George Bush arrogantly dictates to others how it will be done when there has not been a single day in the life of that silver spooned &quot;chicken s%$#&quot; where he has ever had to sacrifice.   It is high time that he be impeached and his notorious legacy be relegated to the trash bin of history. I truly believe leaders like him are a judgment upon this nation.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/4340661250531629966'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7488632550066234769/comments/default/4340661250531629966'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html?showComment=1175652060000#c4340661250531629966' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/04/blackmailer-in-chief-bush-threatens.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488632550066234769' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7488632550066234769' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2007 at 8:01 PM"/></entry></feed>